sections.body:
The App processes information needed to provide its features, including:
• plant names, categories, growing start dates, watering intervals and last-watered dates;
• watering history, care notes and growth records;
• plant and growth-record photos selected by you;
• notification time, language, theme, Widget settings and other preferences;
• Leafia Pro purchase status and information required to restore purchases;
• usage events such as screen views, feature actions and purchase outcomes; and
• crash, device, OS, app-version, launch-time and performance diagnostics.

Plant names, note text, photo data and other user content, Apple IDs, email addresses and names are not sent as Firebase Analytics event parameters.

The App uses:
1. Apple iCloud / CloudKit for storage, backup and restoration when sync is enabled;
2. Apple StoreKit / App Store for Leafia Pro purchases, entitlement checks and restoration. Apple processes payments; the Developer does not receive or store card numbers;
3. Google Firebase Analytics to measure usage and improve features and experience;
4. Google Firebase Crashlytics to detect and diagnose crashes and defects; and
5. Google Firebase Performance Monitoring to measure and improve launch and processing performance.

These services may process device, OS, app, app-instance identifier, usage-event, crash and performance information under Apple’s and Google’s respective privacy policies.

You must not:
• violate law or public order;
• infringe the App’s or another person’s rights;
• disrupt operation of the App;
• gain unauthorised access, reverse engineer, analyse or modify the App, except where expressly permitted by applicable law;
• intentionally exploit defects;
• attempt fraudulent or false purchases, refunds or restorations; or
• engage in conduct the Developer reasonably considers improper.
